codex
The task is `incr_list(l)`, and the reference semantics explicitly supports list comprehensions, integer addition, function calls, and symbolic list iteration. I’m using a direct comprehension because it matches the contract and stays entirely inside the translator’s supported subset; the main proof challenge will be expressing the heap-allocated result without overconstraining temporary allocations.
